      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 511940954,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I think this function itself is incorrect. It disregards offset, thereby checking the first PDU in the UDP packet over and over, instead of subsequent PDUs. This would eliminate the need for this additional check also, since there's no streaming support in the UDP variant of the PDU dissection handler.",
